{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Disclosed.</b> A descriptor and akin to it: וְאָפֵל וְאֵין נֹגַהּ לוֹ (Amos 5:20). The meaning is that they were still under the ground and not visible."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:01.418386617Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}